0-0100 | M (555) 010-0101</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">100 Main Street, Anytown, ST 00000</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"mailto:pat@yourcompany.com\">pat@yourcompany.com</a> | <a href=\"https://www.yourcompany.com/\">www.yourcompany.com</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> Marcus Bell &lt;mbell@copperfieldlogistics.example&gt; <br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, November 3, 2026 6:12 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Pat Staffer &lt;pat@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: Term sheet review<o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sounds good, Thursday at 2 works for me. I will bring our controller.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Marcus<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sent from my iPhone<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Nov 3, 2026, at 4:55 PM, Pat Staffer &lt;<a href=\"mailto:pat@yourcompany.com\">pat@yourcompany.com</a>&gt; wrote:<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Marcus,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Would Thursday afternoon work to go over the term sheet in person? Our office is easy to find, parking is in the back.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Pat Staffer<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Managing Director<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your Company<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your Company Tagline Here<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">O (5